                "text": "Clinics like La Familia may have to turn away families they\u2019ve cared for across generations. Patients could wait months for urgent appointments, leaving conditions untreated. Many will be forced to choose between groceries and medical care. This is the reality they\u2019re bracing for under Republican health care policies.",
