                "text": "\ud83d\udce2 Taos! Join me THIS THURSDAY, Nov. 6 at 5:30pm for a Health Care Town Hall.\n\nACA tax credits are expiring without Congressional action & Republican cuts to Medicare/Medicaid threaten seniors, families & rural care.\n\nCome share your story with me and ask me your questions. https://t.co/5XpothO1se",
